O6SJc7u8Xna","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-06T01:01:33Z","updated_at":"2026-03-06T01:01:33Z","body":"XR Team meeting, going to rebase this and we're going to merge after checking all the input paths.\r\n\r\nAfter that we'll do a separate PR to clean up our default action map so it only contains:\r\n- generic controller\r\n- touch controller\r\n- hand interaction\r\n\r\nWe're leaving out the simple controller as it doesn't cover our use cases and we have runtimes that will preference it over more applicable interaction profiles. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4008802778/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4012602723","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110778#issuecomment-4012602723","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110778","id":4012602723,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7vK3Vj","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-06T16:04:11Z","updated_at":"2026-03-06T16:04:11Z","body":"> After that we'll do a separate PR to clean up our default action map so it only contains:\r\n\r\nTo follow-up on something I said at the XR team meeting yesterday: I just tested on the Pico 4 Ultra, and it looks like I was wrong - it's _not_ able to map to the \"Touch controller\" profile.\r\n\r\nSo, we could either continue with our original planned 3 interaction profiles, but just add the \"Pico 4 controller\" profile to it (which would be my preference, because I'd love to see the default action map get much smaller). Or, be more conservative, and only remove the \"Simple controller\" profile.\r\n\r\nIt's a question of if we're worried that there's more runtimes that can't map to the \"Touch controller\" profile. We can test on all the headsets we have available, but beyond that, we can't really know without going forward with removing most interaction profiles and seeing if users with other headsets find any issues.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4012602723/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4012754194","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110778#issuecomment-4012754194","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110778","id":4012754194,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7vLcUS","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-06T16:33:52Z","updated_at":"2026-03-06T16:33:52Z","body":"> So, we could either continue with our original planned 3 interaction profiles, but just add the \"Pico 4 controller\" profile to it (which would be my preference, because I'd love to see the default action map get much smaller). Or, be more conservative, and only remove the \"Simple controller\" profile.\r\n\r\nI'm in favor of the option of just adding the Pico 4 controller, bearing in mind that new users (who may have a harder time troubleshooting why their controls are not working) will in the majority be using one of Meta, Pico or Google headsets. Whereas advanced users targeting a wider range of devices will know to update the action map.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4012754194/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4021241199","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110778#issuecomment-4021241199","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110778","id":4021241199,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7vr0Vv","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-09T05:22:28Z","updated_at":"2026-03-09T05:22:28Z","body":"yeah I'm in favour of culling everything but just keeping the PICO 4 mapping. Just because we 